15 learning Games for kids (2-4 y.)
Keep your toddlers occupied with 15 different educational games, which will help them learn and improve their skills while having a great fun. 

Have you ever noticed how your toddler gets absorbed by an activity they enjoy? You might even wish they were as attentive to their homework or preschool as they are with games. 

They can't help it. Play is an integral part of development for 2,3,4-year-olds. But what we can do instead is to help them absorb valuable information through fun games. 

We combined 15 fun and educational baby games in one app to help you and your kids navigate through the assortment of activities and puzzles. 

Your toddlers & preschoolers will be able to:
 ► Identify shapes, sizes, and colors by playing toddler puzzles that let you sort objects;
 ► Learn about domestic and wild animals by taking care of them in our baby games;
 ► Learn about healthy food; 

You might even find yourself enjoying a few of these puzzles.. 

Our apps are developed and tested by child development experts. 

Safety and convenience. No supervision needed: 
 ► Parental Gate - Code protected sections so that your child doesn’t accidentally change settings or make unwanted purchases; 
 ► Offline - playable without an internet connection;
 ► Timely hints - so your child doesn't feel frustrated or lost in the app; 
 ► Ads free - no annoying interruptions.

App's 15 learning games provide safe and useful screen time for your 2-4 year old boys and girls.

Who says learning can't be fun?

Baby Panda's Kids Play includes all the BabyBus games and cartoons that kids love. It covers various themes such as life, habits, safety, art, logic and other topics to help kids learn everyday knowledge and exercise their thinking skills through fun Baby Panda games. Check it out!

LIFE SIMULATION
Here kids can go shopping at a supermarket, go surfing at the beach, travel around the world and taste local specialties. Kids can explore the big world and enjoy different lifestyles through different life simulations!

SAFETY HABITS
Baby Panda's Kids Play provides a lot of safety and habit tips for kids. Baby Panda games give kids a chance to practice brushing their teeth, going to the toilet, escaping and saving themselves in a simulated fire. Through such practice, kids gradually develop good living habits and learn to protect themselves.

ART CREATION
There are fun activities like designing makeup for cute cats, making birthday cards for mom, and creating a diamond crown for princess that allow kids to give full play to their design talents and feel the fun of art creation!

LOGIC TRAINING
Logic training is essential in a child's development! Baby Panda's Kids Play is designed with a variety of logic levels, including graphic matching, cube building, and more. There're also detective games that get kids to find clues and help improve their logical thinking skills!

In addition to the Baby Panda Games, a lot of animated videos have been added to Baby Panda's Kids Play: The MeowMi Family, Monster Truck, Sheriff Labrador and other popular cartoons. Open the videos and watch them now!

FEATURES:
- Lots of content for kids: 9 themes and 80+ Baby Panda games for kids to play;
- 800+ episodes of cartoons: The MeowMi Family, Monster Truck, Sheriff Labrador and other cartoons;
- Faster access: no need to download sub-packages to play the games;
- Takes up little memory space on your mobile phone: download size is less than 30M;
- Supports offline mode: play the games anytime and anywhere;
- Completely free: no in-app purchase, no need to subscribe;
- Usage time control: parents can set time limits on use to protect your kids' eyesight;
- Regular update: new games and content will be added every month;
- Lots of new cartoons and mini-games will be available in the future, so please stay tuned!"


